<p>President Trump said on Thursday that he had ordered the US military to &quot;shoot and kill&quot; small Iranian boats that deploy mines in the Strait of Hormuz. CNN separately reported that the order followed a reported Iranian mine-laying operation that the US military observed in the waterway. The directive adds fresh strain to the Iran-US ceasefire and raises the risk of a new military clash in one of the world’s most important shipping chokepoints. Several reports cast the order as part of a broader standoff in and around the Gulf, with one source saying a third US carrier strike group has arrived as tensions rise. The immediate significance is clear: maritime incidents in the Strait can quickly threaten regional stability and commercial traffic.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/g5qkFNj56da3ekCTU5DNG2M-hRLFyaWvoaDWYpRmp2i28iqnSlry2FvvrFERZOYxDzLHqG5jUORWuQJQmr7zNm6n4Kkx5vbHuHpLMBB0o_5Di50GHizz3X_HfFqiPxl-kOGqdCGzOyVRra91SuJ2OSzUes3FSGpswxez4Riqb9H3ZvzDtXdltzwdEnL4Z3NhC2lWu1PcDGOnZwa6dmChyAAiIFIL0T8QXssKWweQHL8OICUbmwYL11sw6p1h0G44ndIlWjO0pGupHwvKauK0EX17En2pgg9Va_b2nSEXEqDQZeZQ4NHhHB0LOEt-xldlaAVmZ9lp12dFpbqNwH6QfoSlGJMj3YtruV8f0gFbN8MmJzZU7uSUsnLDUcOat9WGCS7bcWuZomTCFZdBPA' alt='Image published with reporting on new threats in the Strait of Hormuz' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Ceasefire strain: The Globe and Mail said the latest threats and attacks in the Strait of Hormuz are putting further strain on the Iran-US ceasefire already in place.</li><li>Carrier buildup: WSWS reported that a third US carrier strike group had arrived as President Trump issued the order, pointing to a broader US force buildup around the standoff.</li><li>Reported trigger: CNN said the order followed a reported Iranian mine-laying operation that the US military observed in the Strait of Hormuz.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Trump: He said the US military should open fire on small Iranian boats that place mines in the Strait of Hormuz, signaling a dire